An artifact that depends, through others, on its own group and module is not followed again.
--- module.yaml
product: jvm/lib
repositories:
  - mavenLocal
dependencies:
  - org.example:a:1.0
  - org.example:self:1.0
--- m2/org/example/a/1.0/a-1.0.pom
